        {
          "id": 1601062949,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I changed type to int, found in documentation it can return -1.\n\nI don't quite understand first comment from @JaapKeuter about not comparing the number of remaining bytes.\nI copied this for loop from LTV array parser here:\nhttps://github.com/wireshark/wireshark/blob/master/epan/dissectors/packet-btle.c#L1806\n\nAnd sightly modified it as we don't have opcodes here, just lenght and value.\n\nI tested it on sample captures, and it seems to work ok. Can you please point to some example or doc explaining what I did wrong please ?",
